@startuml fig-ipv4-header
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title IPv4 header: fields in wire order (RFC 791)
note as header
|= Bit offset |= Width (bits) |= Field |
| 0 | 4 | Version |
| 4 | 4 | IHL (header length in 32-bit words) |
| 8 | 6 | DSCP |
| 14 | 2 | ECN |
| 16 | 16 | Total Length (octets) |
| 32 | 16 | Identification |
| 48 | 3 | Flags |
| 51 | 13 | Fragment Offset (8-octet units) |
| 64 | 8 | Time to Live |
| 72 | 8 | Protocol |
| 80 | 16 | Header Checksum |
| 96 | 32 | Source Address |
| 128 | 32 | Destination Address |
| 160 | 0–320 | Options and padding |

Minimum header: 160 bits (20 bytes). Maximum: 480 bits (60 bytes).
Options are padded to a 32-bit boundary; IHL identifies the end.
end note
@enduml
